<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-115.1-calibration-program-standards-and-measurement-traceability" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3617" name="W3617. Calibration &amp; Metrology Program Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual quality/compliance planning (links to VS-31/VS-22); regulatory cycle
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise measurement-device estate
Owner: Metrology Manager / Quality
Participants: Metrology Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Compliance (links to VS-22), IT (links to VS-27), Store Ops (links to VS-07), DC Operations (links to VS-04), Finance (links to VS-17.4), HSE (links to VS-24), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3617 — Calibration &amp; Metrology Program Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3617_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3617_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3617_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3617_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3617_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3617_Lane2" name="Quality Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3617_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3617_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3617_Start4" name="Annual quality/compliance planning (links to VS-31/VS-22); regulatory cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3617_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3617_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Quality define the calibration program strategy and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Quality define the calibration program strategy and governance: scope (POS/catch-weight scales, cutting equipment, paint dispensers, DC weighbridges/truck scales, fuel/logistics meters, environmental/process instruments, test &amp; measurement tools), the regulatory map (DTI-BPS weights &amp; measures, Consumer Act RA 7394, ISO 17025 for labs), the operating model (central standards lab + field/in-house calibration + external labs), and the KPIs (calibration currency, OOT rate, measurement variance, audit findings)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Quality
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3617_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3617_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3617_Task6" name="Metrology Manager establish the metrology governance: Metrology Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager establish the metrology governance: Metrology Manager role/authority, the cross-functional responsibilities (Stores/DC own the device, Metrology owns calibration, Quality owns compliance), the calibration policy, the device-classification scheme (legal-for-trade vs. process-control), and integration to quality (VS-31), facilities (VS-07.2/VS-20.3), and master data (VS-29)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Quality / Compliance
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3617_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3617_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3617_Task7" name="Quality Manager/COO approve the calibration program strategy and policy, ratify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quality Manager/COO approve the calibration program strategy and policy, ratify governance/authorities, allocate the program budget (links to VS-34/VS-17.4), and report metrology posture to the quality/compliance governance (links to VS-31/VS-22) and audit (links to VS-21); communicate the mandate
Responsible (R): Quality Manager / COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3617_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3617_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3617_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3617_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3617_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-145 (ensure measurement traceability &amp; weights-and-measures compliance.) | - operational: Metrology authority; operational: quantified exposure and governance reporting
Owner: Metrology Manager / Quality</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3617_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3617_Annotation9" targetRef="W3617_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3617_Flow11" sourceRef="W3617_Start4" targetRef="W3617_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3617_Flow12" sourceRef="W3617_Task5" targetRef="W3617_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3617_Flow13" sourceRef="W3617_Task6" targetRef="W3617_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3617_Flow14" sourceRef="W3617_Task7" targetRef="W3617_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3617_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3617_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3617">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3617_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3617_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
