    <bpmn:process id="W_W3618" name="W3618. Measurement Standards, Traceability &amp; ISO 17025 Alignment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program strategy (W3617); standards/traceability requirement; audit
Frequency: Maintained + per standard cycle
Volume: Enterprise measurement standards chain
Owner: Metrology Manager
Participants: Metrology Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), External Calibration Labs (W3621), National Metrology Laboratory (NML-ITDI, DOST), Compliance (links to VS-22), Standards Lab (W3622)
Source: workflow W3618 — Measurement Standards, Traceability &amp; ISO 17025 Alignment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3618_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3618_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3618_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3618_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3618_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3618_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3618_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3618_Start3" name="Program strategy (W3617); standards/traceability requirement; audit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3618_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3618_Task4" name="Metrology Manager establish the measurement-traceability chain: each working…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager establish the measurement-traceability chain: each working standard and field device traces through reference/working standards in the standards lab (W3622) to a national standard (the National Metrology Laboratory — NML under DOST-ITDI — or another recognized National Metrology Institute), with documented uncertainty per the GUM (Guide to the Expression of Uncertainty in Measurement); maintain the traceability hierarchy
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Standards Lab
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3618_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3618_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3618_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Quality align the in-house calibration function to ISO/IEC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Quality align the in-house calibration function to ISO/IEC 17025 (general requirements for the competence of calibration/testing laboratories) where BuildRight operates an in-house standards lab (W3622): quality system, documented procedures, uncertainty budgets, environmental control, equipment, and personnel competency; pursue accreditation where it adds value
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Quality
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3618_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3618_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3618_Task6" name="Metrology Manager maintain the reference/working standards (calibrated against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager maintain the reference/working standards (calibrated against national/recognized standards on cycle), manage standards custody/handling, and reconcile the traceability chain for audit (links to VS-31/VS-21/W3624); report traceability integrity to governance (W3640)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Standards Lab
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3618_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3618_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3618_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3618_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3618_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-574 (ensure controlled execution — Calibration Program, Standards &amp; Measurement Traceability (PA-115.1).) | - operational: traceability chain and accredited labs; operational: GUM-compliant uncertainty budgets
Owner: Metrology Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3618_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3618_Annotation8" targetRef="W3618_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3618_Flow10" sourceRef="W3618_Start3" targetRef="W3618_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3618_Flow11" sourceRef="W3618_Task4" targetRef="W3618_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3618_Flow12" sourceRef="W3618_Task5" targetRef="W3618_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3618_Flow13" sourceRef="W3618_Task6" targetRef="W3618_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3618_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3618_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3618">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3618_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3618_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3618_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W3618_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
