    <bpmn:process id="W_W3621" name="W3621. External Calibration Lab Qualification &amp; Vendor Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Calibration outsourcing decision; lab sourcing; lab performance review
Frequency: Per lab + ongoing
Volume: External calibration labs (accredited)
Owner: Metrology Manager / Procurement
Participants: Metrology Manager, Procurement (links to VS-34), Quality (links to VS-31), Compliance (links to VS-22), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3621 — External Calibration Lab Qualification &amp; Vendor Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3621_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3621_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3621_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3621_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3621_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3621_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3621_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3621_Start3" name="Calibration outsourcing decision; lab sourcing; lab performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3621_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3621_Task4" name="Metrology Manager/Procurement define external-lab qualification criteria…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Procurement define external-lab qualification criteria: ISO/IEC 17025 accreditation scope (the lab must be accredited for the specific calibration), traceability to national/international standards (W3618), uncertainty capability, turnaround, geographic coverage (on-site for weighbridges/large devices), and accreditation-body recognition (PAB or ILAC-MRA signatory)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Procurement / Quality
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per sourcing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3621_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3621_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3621_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Procurement qualify and contract external labs: due diligence…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Metrology Manager/Procurement qualify and contract external labs: due diligence (accreditation certificate/scope verification), contract (scope, turnaround, uncertainty, recall/OOT notification, liability), rate/SLA, and the approved-lab list; integrate to vendor management (links to VS-03) and the scorecard (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Procurement / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Quality Manager / VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per lab</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3621_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3621_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3621_Task6" name="Metrology Manager manage external-lab performance: monitor turnaround, quality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager manage external-lab performance: monitor turnaround, quality (calibration acceptance, OOT notification), accreditation currency, and cost; re-qualify periodically, manage the approved lab list, and route devices to the optimal lab (in-house vs. external); report to governance (W3640)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3621_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3621_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3621_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3621_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3621_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-574 (ensure controlled execution — Calibration Program, Standards &amp; Measurement Traceability (PA-115.1).) | - operational: accreditation-scope verification; operational: SLA and dual-sourcing
Owner: Metrology Manager / Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3621_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3621_Annotation8" targetRef="W3621_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
