    <bpmn:process id="W_W3622" name="W3622. In-House Calibration Operations &amp; Standards Lab" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Calibration schedule (W3620); device due
Frequency: Per device + recurring schedule
Volume: In-house-calibratable devices (field/portable/process devices)
Owner: Metrology Manager / Standards Lab
Participants: Metrology Manager, Calibration Technicians (W3623), Standards Lab, Device Owners (Stores/DC/Services/Facilities), Quality (links to VS-31), IT/CMMS (links to VS-27/VS-20.3)
Source: workflow W3622 — In-House Calibration Operations &amp; Standards Lab</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3622_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3622_Lane1" name="Metrology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3622_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3622_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3622_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3622_Lane2" name="Calibration Technicians">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3622_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3622_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3622_Start4" name="Calibration schedule (W3620); device due">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3622_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3622_Task5" name="Metrology Manager/Standards Lab operate the in-house calibration function…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Metrology Manager/Standards Lab operate the in-house calibration function: schedule and dispatch calibration (CMMS-driven links to W3620), calibrate field/portable devices (POS scale verification, cutting/paint dispensers, environmental instruments, test tools) using reference/working standards (W3618), perform on-site calibration for installed devices (weighbridges, large scales, fuel meters)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Calibration Technicians / Standards Lab
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per device + schedule</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3622_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3622_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3622_Task6" name="Calibration Technicians perform calibration per documented procedure and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Calibration Technicians perform calibration per documented procedure and tolerance (W3619): pre-check, as-found verification, adjustment, as-left verification, uncertainty estimation, pass/fail/OOT determination (links to W3634), labeling/sealing (legal-for-trade seals), and the calibration certificate/record (W3624); return to service or quarantine if OOT
Responsible (R): Calibration Technicians
Accountable (A): Metrology Manager
Duration: Per device</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3622_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3622_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3622_Task7" name="Metrology Manager/Standards Lab maintain the standards lab environment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Metrology Manager/Standards Lab maintain the standards lab environment (temperature/humidity/control per ISO 17025 where applicable), reference/working-standard custody and re-calibration (W3618), and consumables/tools; manage the in-house vs. external routing decision (W3621); report in-house throughput/quality to governance (W3640)
Responsible (R): Metrology Manager / Standards Lab
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3622_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3622_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3622_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3622_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3622_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-574 (ensure controlled execution — Calibration Program, Standards &amp; Measurement Traceability (PA-115.1).) | - operational: reference-standard re-calibration cycle; operational: procedures, competency (W3623), and MSA (W3638)
Owner: Metrology Manager / Standards Lab</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3622_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3622_Annotation9" targetRef="W3622_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
